74303,"name":"Oscar Berthe","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qCapoqWQh0EjqVG4wbdxOdO4GU3.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Volami via","overview":"Thomas a quasi 30 anni si comporta ancora come un adolescente. Non lavora, fa festa tutte le sere, passa le giornate a letto in attesa di una nuova notte per uscire a divertirsi. Ma dopo la classica goccia che fa traboccare il vaso, il padre decide che è arrivato il momento per lui di crescere. Gli affida così un suo paziente. Marcus ha 12 anni ed è disabile, ma questo non gli impedisce di essere un ragazzo curioso ed entusiasta di tutto quello che la vita possa offrirgli. Il patto è semplice tra padre e figlio: se Thomas non sarà in grado di occuparsi di Marcus, dovrà andarsene di casa e iniziare a cavarsela finalmente da solo..."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Fly Me Away","overview":"Thomas, a blasé young man, spends his nights in clubs and his days in bed. Until his father, Dr. Reinhard, fed up with his son’s escapades, cuts him off completely and forces him to take care of one of his young patients. Mar- cus, 12, was born with a serious congenital disorder. He lives with his mother in the poor suburbs of Paris and spends his days either at the hospital or in a center for sick children. This encounter will disrupt their lives and change them both, profoundly and forever."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Thomas passe ses nuits en boites et ses journées au lit, jusqu’au jour où son père, le docteur Reinhard, lassé de ses frasques, décide de lui couper les vivres et lui impose de s’occuper d’un de ses jeunes patients. Marcus a douze ans et vit seul avec sa maman. Il souffre depuis sa naissance d’une maladie grave qui rythme ses journées, entre le centre d’accueil médicalisé où il est scolarisé et des séjours répétés à l’hôpital. Cette rencontre va bouleverser le quotidien de l’un et de l’autre, et tout simplement changer leur vie.","tagline":"Une touchante histoire d'amitié qui inspire."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dsf1vC0KdirMns7JzHRHzqB8Y0C.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yubYUzjlrIMTHpXwJTRfiRuAu01.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":783558,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dsf1vC0KdirMns7JzHRHzqB8Y0C.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dsf1vC0KdirMns7JzHRHzqB8Y0C.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dsf1vC0KdirMns7JzHRHzqB8Y0C.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dsf1vC0KdirMns7JzHRHzqB8Y0C.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i5brVH61okbGfeQntpvMu3Vgha2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i5brVH61okbGfeQntpvMu3Vgha2.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i5brVH61okbGfeQntpvMu3Vgha2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i5brVH61okbGfeQntpvMu3Vgha2.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"fr":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Aviebr72gvK9I73m68Go3K4hq1r.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Aviebr72gvK9I73m68Go3K4hq1r.jpg","language":"fr","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Aviebr72gvK9I73m68Go3K4hq1r.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Aviebr72gvK9I73m68Go3K4hq1r.jpg","language":"fr","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ttWvx4qAOfpiRSdHD8cYcwJJ0dq.jpg","previewUrl":"https: